# Mercantile reputation glyph — a standing merchant's balance scale, 32x32
# master. Hand-shaded to the same fidelity as the sibling HUD masters; the
# HUD overlay and the reputation detail panel multiply by the per-tier color
# at draw time, so the body is authored neutral-emerald. Palette: DESIGN.md
# §1 emerald accents + a gold pivot.
size: 32
kind: sprite

legend:
  . transparent
  K #0a0a0a                       # ink outline
  E #50c878                       # mercantile.emerald — body
  e #6ddb94                       # mercantile.emerald-bright — highlight
  d #2c8a57                       # deeper emerald — facet shadow
  s #1f6b41                       # deepest emerald — underside
  o #ffd700                       # gold — pivot
  g #b8860b                       # deep gold — pivot shadow

